# Interdimensional Web Watch: "When this artifact enters, exile the top two cards of your library. Until the end of your
# next turn, you may play those cards." and "{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast
# spells from exile" (CR 106.6, 601.2a). Turn 1 (Black Lotus and the Mountain pay for it) it exiles Lightning Bolt and a
# Mountain from the top; tapped for {R}{R} its mana can't cast the Lightning Bolt in the hand (every land tapped) - the
# refusal - but casts the exiled one at Bot2; the {R} left can't pay Sensei's Divining Top's "{1}: Look at the top three
# cards" either, an ability and no spell (the Top was cast with Mox Ruby's {R}, the Mox tapped). Turn 3, Bot1's next turn, the exiled Mountain is played from exile (a land
# play, CR 305.1), and the Watch's two mana are of two colors this time, {W}{G} (CR 106.1b).

